  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program shall contribute to the launching of a new stage in the Country&apos;s process of health sector reform. Emerging challenges arise from (a) the need to implement the new and specialized functions the Ministry of Health has acquired (Stewardship and Regulation), and (b) support the Caja Costarricense del Seguro Social in developing and implementing capacities to provide healtrh promotion services.</narrative>
